  "question_count": 5,
  "summary": "Why this pipeline\n\u2022 Invoice payment confirmation. Match bank statement receipts to the customer invoice register by customer name, check whether the amount paid matches the invoice total, and tell me for each invoice if it is paid, short, overpaid, or not paid.\n\nWhat each step does\n1. Bank_Statement_June \u2014 Reads working file Bank_Statement_June.xlsx and detects its columns.\n2. Customer_Invoices \u2014 Reads working file Customer_Invoices.xlsx and detects its columns.\n3. AR_Collections_Policy \u2014 Reads the policy/reference file AR_Collections_Policy.pdf and keeps the rules for matching and review.\n4. Matcher \u2014 Pairs rows that share Customer Name. Dates may drift by 30 day(s). Leftovers and splits go to exceptions.\n5. Math \u2014 Applies: abs(actual - expected) > min(0.01 * expected, 50.00).\n6. Decision \u2014 Flags or approves using: Anything unpaid more than thirty days past due is collections, citing the AR policy..\n7. Output \u2014 Builds a Excel report you can download.",
  "extra": {
    "onboarding_step": "done",
    "role": "AR collections analyst on the O2C team",
    "industry": "Manufacturing \u2014 mid-market industrial, USD only.",
    "ai_priorities": "Confirm which customer invoices actually got paid from the bank feed, and surface shorts and unpaid items.",
    "description": "Invoice payment confirmation. Match bank statement receipts to the customer invoice register by customer name, check whether the amount paid matches the invoice total, and tell me for each invoice if it is paid, short, overpaid, or not paid.",
    "knowledge_facts": [
      {
        "id": "fact-1",
        "kind": "entity",
        "value": "Helios Industrial",
        "chunk_id": "AR_Collections_Policy-e8ba05333a"
      },
      {
        "id": "fact-2",
        "kind": "constraint",
        "value": "The invoice register is the source of truth for what is owed.",
        "chunk_id": "AR_Collections_Policy-9e0bb249f8"
      },
      {
        "id": "fact-3",
        "kind": "constraint",
        "value": "Do not use amount as a match key.",
        "chunk_id": "AR_Collections_Policy-59ca61c8d7"
      },
      {
        "id": "fact-4",
        "kind": "threshold",
        "value": "Allow the lesser of 1% of the invoice total or USD 50.00.",
        "chunk_id": "AR_Collections_Policy-f8f929a7a4"
      },
      {
        "id": "fact-5",
        "kind": "formula",
        "value": "abs(actual \u2212 expected) > min(0.01 \u00d7 expected, 50.00)",
        "chunk_id": "AR_Collections_Policy-f8f929a7a4"
      },
      {
        "id": "fact-6",
